OL,3,GNEWSAPurchase of field aims to expand
OL,4,A'green lung'
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservationists have said they are
OL,7,Fplanning to buy a field to extend a
OL,8,F"green lung" in one of Jersey's most
OL,9,Fbuilt-up parishes.
OL,11,FThe National Trust for Jersey said it
OL,12,Fhad secured the rights to acquire the
OL,13,Fland near Maupertuis Farm in St Clement
OL,14,Fand hoped to complete the purchase
OL,15,Fshortly.
OL,17,FA green lung is an area of fields,
OL,18,Fparkland or vegetation within an
OL,19,Fotherwise urban area, providing space
OL,20,Ffor wildlife and helping to reduce
OL,21,Fpollution.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
